  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MUVA - Support to Gender Sensitive Social Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a national women&#x2019;s empowerment NGO delivering innovative and transformative approaches to implement the GoM&#x2019;s Public Works Programme (PASP) for women and youth. The programme will improve the skills of young people and facilitate their transition into the labour market. By 2024, the programme will reach up to 2,000 young people, 50% of which will be women.</narrative>
  </description>
